d with each other, so C4 refuses as within one call  refused [\"('NVIDIA', 'revenue', 'company', 'FY2027 Q3') base: 2 forecast nodes (v14.q3_total_a, v14.q3_total_b); exactly one per scenario is required\"]\nPASS  abstain: an unresolved singleton is published and can be read with its card as the ground  \nPASS  verdict: a key that maps packets to other units: INCOMPLETE  packets.md is not the text the run and the key give\nPASS  verdict: decisions written into the key are ignored; the run decides (STOP stays STOP)  STOP\nPASS  torn journal: recover keeps the committed entries, marks the torn attempt interrupted and the line damaged, sends nothing  single-E|single|3: interrupted\nPASS  verdict: a damaged journal line makes the verdict INCOMPLETE  answers.jsonl line 72 is damaged\nPASS  a refused first answer whose retry was never sent is incomplete, not refused or not sent  \n48 of 48 checks pass\nPASS  00 control  48 of 48 checks pass\nCAUGHT  01 equivalence is exact equality  FAIL  separate-agree-float: Q3 forecasts equal within floating-point error are unified, and the pair reconcile\nCAUGHT  02 a transport failure counts as finished  FAIL  verdict: a unit failed in transport makes the verdict INCOMPLETE  P21 K1 usable: reader A gave no yes/no\nCAUGHT  03 an attempt in flight is not seen  FAIL  interrupt: results are written from the records; the unit in flight is interrupted, the rest not sent  {\nCAUGHT  04 results only on a clean exit  crash: FileNotFoundError: [Errno 2] No such file or directory: '/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-lchingen-hivemind/f1ea972d-85a1-4f27-8010-cf0b60054109/scratchpad/paid-mutants-47c4/m04/work/interrupt/results.j\nCAUGHT  05 a first refusal with no retry counts as unresolved  FAIL  a refused first answer whose retry was never sent is incomplete, not refused or not sent  \nCAUGHT  06 any text is a ground  FAIL  verdict: ground naming nothing in the packet: INCOMPLETE  \nCAUGHT  07 the key is not bound to the run  FAIL  verdict: a run changed after the packets were frozen: INCOMPLETE  packets.md is not the text the run and\nCAUGHT  08 the readings are not bound to the packets  FAIL  verdict: readings made on other packets: INCOMPLETE  \nCAUGHT  09 the packets can be remade  FAIL  packets: a second packets run is refused, the key unchanged  \nCAUGHT  10 a card shows the whole calculation  FAIL  card view: own figures only, renumbered; the assumption record mapped, the other card's left out  [{\"fig\nCAUGHT  11 assumption records keep their raw ids  FAIL  card view: own figures only, renumbered; the assumption record mapped, the other card's left out  [{\"fig\nCAUGHT  12 a reconciled card shows the merged calculation  FAIL  packets: a reconciled card is shown with its own original derivation, not the unified copy  P15\nCAUGHT  13 only the last attempt is listed  FAIL  packets: every attempt is listed with its own answer, neutral labels and no check codes  P02\nCAUGHT  14 earlier attempts are listed without their answers  FAIL  packets: every attempt is listed with its own answer, neutral labels and no check codes  P21\nCAUGHT  15 duplicates inside one call are unified  FAIL  separate-within-dup-shared: two equal shared forecasts within one call are not unified with each other, \nCAUGHT  16 a card is not a ground  FAIL  abstain: an unresolved singleton is published and can be read with its card as the ground  P01 K1 usable\nCAUGHT  17 the key alone maps packets to units  FAIL  verdict: a key that maps packets to other units: INCOMPLETE  the readings were not made on the frozen pa\nCAUGHT  18 a torn journal line stops the summary  crash: json.decoder.JSONDecodeError: Expecting ',' delimiter: line 1 column 532 (char 531)\nCAUGHT  19 a damaged line does not make the verdict incomplete  FAIL  verdict: a damaged journal line makes the verdict INCOMPLETE  single-E|single|3: interrupted\n19 of 19 mutants caught; control passes\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
